  ->  Index Only Scan using ioc_t_pkey on ioc_t  (cost=0.18..24.66 rows=850 width=4)
        Index Cond: (id > ((((((abs(abs(abs(abs(ioc_o.f1)))) + 1) + 1) + 1) + 1) + 1) + 1))
