> set enable_indexscan = off
-- SET

> set enable_bitmapscan = on
-- SET

> explain
> select * from ioc_o, ioc_t where ioc_t.id > abs(abs(abs(abs(ioc_o.f1)))) + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1
QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop  (cost=8.37..271.35 rows=4250 width=8)
  ->  Seq Scan on ioc_o  (cost=0.00..1.05 rows=5 width=4)
  ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on ioc_t  (cost=8.37..45.56 rows=850 width=4)
        Recheck Cond: (id > ((((((abs(abs(abs(abs(ioc_o.f1)))) + 1) + 1) + 1) + 1) + 1) + 1))
        ->  Bitmap Index Scan on ioc_t_pkey  (cost=0.00..8.15 rows=850 width=0)
              Index Cond: (id > ((((((abs(abs(abs(abs(ioc_o.f1)))) + 1) + 1) + 1) + 1) + 1) + 1))
